| phone=+351 923 132 488 | tollfree= | fax=
| hours=Daily 19:00-23:00 | price=€15-30
|lastedit=2021-09-29| content=On the location of a historical café (the ''leitaria''), this place focuses on only a short number of dishes (meats, fish and seafood) but makes up for this in quality and portion size. For an atmospheric presentation ask for one of their ''espetadas''. The wines complement the dishes and you can end the meal with a dessert. For someone looking for great value for their buck (no compromises on quality), it's a good place to start or end an evening.
}}
* {{eat | name=Mercado da Praça da Figueira | alt= | url=https://varn.pt/mercado-da-praca-da-figueira/ | email=mercadodafigueira@varn.pt | address=Praça da Figueira 10B | lat=38.7141 | long=-9.1372 | directions= | phone=+351 211 450 650 | tollfree= | hours=Mon–Sat 08:30–20:00, closed Sun | price= | lastedit=2021-01-08 | content=From the pavement looks like a small convenience shop, on walking in you realize the deception when confronted by the large cavernous meandering interior space, replete with everything expected from a well stocked supermarket. Although there isn't a restaurant as such, the ready to eat items on offer are tasty, fresh, inexpensive and varied. The sandwiches and hamburgers are superb.
}} {{Dead link|date=October 2026 |bot=InternetArchiveBot }}
